   "id": "tag15",
   "why": "sSpritePaletteTags[15]. THE ONE THAT MATTERS. LoadSpritePalette returns 0xFF when every slot is taken, CreateSprite assigns that into oam.paletteNum, and oam.paletteNum is a 4-BIT field -- so 0xFF truncates to 15. An NPC past the budget does not vanish; it renders in whatever this slot holds.",
